---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import Tag from '../components/Tag.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Layout
  canonical="index.html"
  title="Suites With Keith | Better Rooms. Better Trips."
  description="Better Rooms. Better Trips. Hotel recommendations from an advisor who tours the rooms before recommending them. Europe, honeymoons, and hotels worth the airfare. Booking is complimentary."
  preload="/video/gundari-hero-poster.jpg"
  navOverlay={true}
>

<Fragment slot="head">
  <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TravelAgency","name":"Suites With Keith","url":"https://suiteswithkeith.com/","description":"Luxury travel advisory specializing in honeymoon planning, hotel bookings, and bespoke itineraries across Europe and beyond. Booking is complimentary.","image":"https://suiteswithkeith.com/images/personal/gundari-sunset.jpg","email":"keith.pence@fora.travel","sameAs":["https://instagram.com/suiteswithkeith","https://www.foratravel.com/advisor/keith-pence"],"founder":{"@type":"Person","name":"Keith Pence","jobTitle":"Luxury Travel Advisor"},"areaServed":"Worldwide","priceRange":"$$$","aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":"5.0","reviewCount":"6","bestRating":"5"},"review":[{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Tyler & Spencer C."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"With less than 24 hours' notice we needed a hotel in Saint-Tropez in peak season. Keith stepped in with the perfect recommendation and personally contacted the hotel before our arrival. When we pulled up, the staff greeted us by name, welcomed us with cold towels, and surprised us with a complimentary upgrade."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Nida T."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Keith found me this place and knew exactly what I was looking for. He listened to my needs and sent me great recommendations. It was even hard to narrow it down between those options as I loved them all. He handled everything, from booking to communications, and I didn't have to worry about a thing."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sue P."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Keith was extremely helpful and knowledgeable about all areas of Paris. Without his guidance, we wouldn't have thought to stay in an area we're not familiar with. We look forward to booking our next trip with Keith."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Stephanie F."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Keith made me believe in using travel agents again. He carefully put together thoughtful options and called out why he would choose each. He took so much work off my shoulders."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Kai Yu W."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"On our first night in Greece there was a snafu with our hotel. We let Keith know, he communicated on our behalf to the hotel team, and the hotel went above and beyond in addressing it, including giving us an upgrade. Super grateful to have a travel advisor advocate on your behalf."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Caitlin M."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Keith is absolutely fantastic at what he does. Extremely responsive and quick to help with anything I need. I've already used his services four times in the past two months. Worth its weight in gold. I won't ever book a stay without Keith again."}]}</script>
</Fragment>

<!-- 1 · The claim -->
<header class="hero hero--video">
  <video class="hero-video" autoplay loop muted playsinline preload="metadata"
    poster="/video/gundari-hero-poster.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
    <source src="/video/gundari-hero.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
  </video>
  <div class="container">
    <Tag as="p">Issue No. 02 &middot; The Napa &amp; Sonoma Collection &middot; out now</Tag>
    <h1 class="display-xl">Better rooms.<br><em>Better trips.</em></h1>
    <p class="sub">Hotel recommendations from someone who&rsquo;s stood in the rooms. There are 156 on file across four continents, including 38 toured in Greece this spring and 45 in Italy this October. Booking is complimentary, and the advice comes with it.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas on-shadow">
      <Button href="#inquire" data-gtag-label="start_planning" data-gtag-location="hero">Tell me where you&rsquo;re going</Button>
      <Button variant="on-dark" href="/featured-destinations.html" data-gtag-label="see_destinations" data-gtag-location="hero">See the destinations</Button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <span class="hero-cue" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</header>

<!-- 2 · The evidence -->
<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <Tag>The evidence</Tag>
      <h2 class="display-l">Counted, and on file</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger reveal">
      <div class="ledger-row"><span class="n">156</span><span class="d"><b>Hotels on file</b>. All researched, compared and written up across Europe, the Greek islands, Asia, Africa and the Americas, from <a href="/hotels/aman-kyoto.html">Aman Kyoto</a> to <a href="/hotels/erema-milos.html">Er&emacr;ma on Milos</a>. The ones I&rsquo;ve slept in say so.</span></div>
      <div class="ledger-row"><span class="n">45</span><span class="d"><b>Toured and stayed in, most recently</b>: Italy this October, room by room. Every destination I recommend gets this treatment sooner or later; Italy was simply this fall&rsquo;s trip.</span></div>
      <div class="ledger-row"><span class="n">02</span><span class="d"><b>Collections. The second is out now.</b> Issue No. 01, Greece, in print; Issue No. 02, Napa &amp; Sonoma, published September 15. The field notes behind the recommendations.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3 · The judgment -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <Tag>The judgment</Tag>
      <h2 class="display-l">Santorini or Mykonos?</h2>
      <p class="deck" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:44ch;">The Cyclades&rsquo; two headliners, and the first question every Greece trip has to answer. No hotel will pick a side. I will, and it takes about thirty seconds.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="choose reveal">
      <a class="choose-col" href="/santorini-vs-mykonos.html" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <Tag>Choose Santorini</Tag>
        <h3>If the caldera is the reason you&rsquo;re coming</h3>
        <p class="lead">Two or three nights in a cave suite on the cliff. It’s the classic picture, and it earns its reputation. Save it for the end of the trip.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="choose-col" href="/santorini-vs-mykonos.html" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <Tag>Choose Mykonos</Tag>
        <h3>If you want range: the loud island and the quiet one</h3>
        <p class="lead">The island that surprised me most, with some of the best hotels, meals and service of my entire Cyclades trip. Beach clubs by day, serious tables at night.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="reveal" style="margin-top:26px;"><a class="link-stamp" href="/santorini-vs-mykonos.html">Read the full head-to-head &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4 · The advocacy -->
<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <Tag>Same rate, sometimes better</Tag>
      <h2 class="display-l">You can book the room.<br>You can&rsquo;t make them know you.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal adv-grid">
      <p class="story-quote">&ldquo;With less than 24 hours&rsquo; notice we needed a hotel in Saint-Tropez in peak season. Keith stepped in with the perfect recommendation and personally contacted the hotel before our arrival. <b>When we pulled up, the staff greeted us by name</b>, welcomed us with cold towels, and surprised us with a complimentary upgrade.&rdquo;</p>
      <div>
        <p class="attr">Tyler &amp; Spencer C. &middot; COMO Le Beauvallon &middot; Saint-Tropez</p>
        <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:20px; max-width:52ch;">The rate through me is the one you&rsquo;d pay booking direct, and sometimes it&rsquo;s better. What changes is who calls the hotel before you arrive, and who answers while you&rsquo;re there.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4b · The clients: the panel band -->
<section class="section section--panel" id="clients">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <Tag>What clients say</Tag>
      <h2 class="display-l">Booked through me, in their words</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-grid reveal">
      <figure class="proof">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;He handled everything, from booking to communications, and I didn&rsquo;t have to worry about a thing.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Nida T. &middot; Tuscany</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="proof">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;There was a snafu with our hotel on our first night in Greece. Keith communicated on our behalf, and the hotel went above and beyond, including an upgrade.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Kai Yu W. &middot; Santorini</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="proof">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;Worth its weight in gold. I won&rsquo;t ever book a stay without Keith again.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Caitlin M. &middot; Four Seasons Napa Valley</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="proof">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;He made sure the hotel helped to celebrate our anniversary and checked in with us during our stay to ensure we were happy and well taken care of.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Chris N. &middot; Meadowood</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="proof">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;Keith thought of every detail including welcome bubbly and treats, booking all our dining and spa reservations.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Craig H. &middot; MacArthur Place</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="proof">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;I love booking hotels through you. I&rsquo;m going to spread the word to everyone: they need to book through you if they stay at a nice hotel!&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Carla &middot; The Beverly Hills Hotel</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <p class="reveal" style="margin-top:24px; font-size:13px; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', Didot, Georgia, serif;"><a href="https://www.foratravel.com/advisor/keith-pence" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--brass); text-decoration:none;">&#9733; 5.00 from 8 verified reviews on Fora &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 5 · Field notes, on the site -->
<section class="section" id="field-notes">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Field notes &middot; On the site</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Written on site, <em>not from the press kit</em></h2>
      <p class="deck" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:44ch;">How I review hotels on this site, one write-up at a time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fn-grid reveal">
      <a class="fn-card" href="/hotels/canaves-epitome-santorini.html">
        <img src="/images/hotels/canaves-epitome-1.jpg" alt="The pool at Canaves Epitome looking out to the Aegean at dusk" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <span class="fn-label">Field notes, no. 01 &middot; Santorini</span>
        <h3>Canaves Epitome</h3>
        <p>If you're asking me for the single best hotel I experienced across the Greek islands on this trip, it's Canaves Epitome.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="fn-card" href="/hotels/il-sereno-lake-como.html">
        <img src="/images/proposals/lake-como/il-sereno/pool-deck-film.jpg" alt="The pool deck at Il Sereno on the edge of Lake Como, shot on film" width="1279" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <span class="fn-label">Field notes, no. 02 &middot; Lake Como</span>
        <h3>Il Sereno</h3>
        <p>I stayed at Il Sereno in October 2026, and I truly couldn&rsquo;t find one fault with anything. The service, the food, the views, the room and the privacy all just work.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="fn-card" href="/hotels/four-seasons-napa-valley.html">
        <img src="/images/napa/four-seasons-1.jpg" alt="Four Seasons Napa Valley among the vineyards in Calistoga" width="1800" height="1013" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <span class="fn-label">Field notes, no. 03 &middot; Napa Valley</span>
        <h3>Four Seasons Napa Valley</h3>
        <p>I've stayed at Four Seasons Napa Valley four or five times now, and since they've worked out the early kinks, I think they've earned the #02 spot in my Napa &amp; Sonoma ranking.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container"><hr class="divider"></div>

<!-- 5b · The Collection: field notes, in print -->
<section class="section" id="collection">
  <div class="container collection-grid">
    <div class="sec-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:0;">
      <Tag>Field notes &middot; In print &middot; Issue No. 02</Tag>
      <h2 class="display-l">The field notes, in print</h2>
      <p class="deck" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:40ch;">Once a quarter, one destination in print. Issue No. 02 is a firsthand journal of wine country: ten hotels across four bases, where to eat and taste town by town, and the research behind every verdict on this site.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:26px;"><Button variant="secondary" href="/greece-collection.html">Read Issue No. 01</Button></p>
    </div>
    <figure class="reveal" style="margin:0; max-width:520px;">
      <img src="/images/personal/greece-collection-cover-mockup.jpg" alt="The Greece Collection, Issue No. 01, printed magazine" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container"><Divider /></div>

<!-- 6 · The range -->
<section class="section" id="range">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <Tag>The destinations</Tag>
      <h2 class="display-l">Where I plan most often</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="dest-list reveal">
  <li><a class="dest-row" href="/best-hotels-greece.html">
    <p class="dest-meta"><span class="dest-num">01</span><span class="dest-kicker">The Cyclades</span></p>
    <h3 class="dest-name">Greece</h3>
    <img class="dest-img" src="/images/personal/gundari-pool-wall.jpg" alt="A plunge pool against a dark stone wall at Gundari on Folegandros, with the Aegean beyond" width="1350" height="1800" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <p class="dest-desc">Eight islands toured this spring. Here are my ten favorite hotels, ranked.</p>
  </a></li>
  <li><a class="dest-row" href="/italy.html">
    <p class="dest-meta"><span class="dest-num">02</span><span class="dest-kicker">The Dolomites to Tuscany</span></p>
    <h3 class="dest-name">Italy</h3>
    <img class="dest-img" src="/images/lake-como/grand-hotel-tremezzo/speedboat-film.jpg" alt="A wooden speedboat on Lake Como at Grand Hotel Tremezzo, shot on film" width="1600" height="1225" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <p class="dest-desc">The Dolomites, Lake Como, the Riviera, Tuscany and Florence. <em>Still to come: Venice, Rome and the Amalfi Coast.</em></p>
  </a></li>
  <li><a class="dest-row" href="/napa-sonoma.html">
    <p class="dest-meta"><span class="dest-num">03</span><span class="dest-kicker">Wine country</span></p>
    <h3 class="dest-name">Napa &amp; Sonoma</h3>
    <img class="dest-img" src="/images/personal/napa-sunset-path.jpg" alt="Sunset over a garden path and dark wood guest buildings in Napa Valley" width="1350" height="1800" style="object-position: center 55%;" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <p class="dest-desc">Nine hotels, ranked from personal stays.</p>
  </a></li>
  <li><a class="dest-row" href="/featured-destinations.html#mexico">
    <p class="dest-meta"><span class="dest-num">04</span><span class="dest-kicker">Cabo &amp; Punta Mita</span></p>
    <h3 class="dest-name">Mexico</h3>
    <img class="dest-img" src="/images/hotels/chileno-bay-1.jpg" alt="Sunset over the infinity pool at Chileno Bay, Los Cabos" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <p class="dest-desc">The Pacific-coast resorts I send clients to first.</p>
  </a></li>
</ol>
    <p class="reveal" style="margin-top:26px;"><a class="link-stamp" href="/destination-guides.html" data-gtag-label="all_guides" data-gtag-location="range">All destinations &amp; guides &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 7 · The ask -->
<section class="section section--panel inquire" id="inquire">
  <div class="container">
    <Tag class="reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">One question</Tag>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">Where and when?</h2>
    <p class="deck reveal" style="margin:18px auto 0; max-width:38ch;">&ldquo;Santorini in June&rdquo; is a complete answer. I&rsquo;ll take it from there.</p>
    <p class="proof-line reveal">&ldquo;Keith made me believe in using travel agents again.&rdquo;<span>Stephanie F. &middot; <a href="/hotels/capella-kyoto.html">Capella Kyoto</a></span></p>
    <form class="inquire-form reveal" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgnadov" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Website Inquiry" />
      <input type="hidden" name="page" value="index" />
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="step1">
        <label for="q-when">Where and when?</label>
        <input id="q-when" type="text" name="travel_dates" placeholder="Santorini in June" required autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div class="step2">
        <label for="q-name">And where do I send the recommendation?</label>
        <input id="q-name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="name" />
        <input id="q-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required autocomplete="email" />
        <label for="q-details" style="margin-top:2px;">Anything else? Nights, budget, occasion (optional)</label>
        <input id="q-details" type="text" name="details" placeholder="7 nights &middot; around $1,500/night &middot; anniversary" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <Button type="submit">Send</Button>
      <p class="note">Traveling within the next 30 days? You&rsquo;ll hear from me today.</p>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>


<style>
  .proof-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .proof { margin: 0; padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px) 0; }
  .proof + .proof { border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .proof blockquote { margin: 0; font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 1.7vw, var(--text-pull-quote)); line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ink); }
  .proof figcaption { margin-top: 18px; font-family: var(--font-stamp); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ash);font-weight:400; }
  .proof-line { margin: 22px auto 0; max-width: 36ch; font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.12rem); line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ash); }
  .proof-line span { display: block; margin-top: 8px; font-family: var(--font-stamp); font-style: normal; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase;font-weight:400; }
.ledger-row .d a, .proof-line span a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .proof-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
    .proof { padding: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px) clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 34px); }
    .proof + .proof { border-top: none; border-left: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
    .proof:nth-child(3n+1) { padding-left: 0; border-left: none; }
    .proof:nth-child(3n) { padding-right: 0; }
    .proof:nth-child(n+4) { border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  }
  .collection-grid { display: grid; gap: var(--grid-gap); grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: center; }
  .adv-grid { display: grid; gap: 40px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .collection-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .collection-grid figure { justify-self: center; }
    .adv-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr; align-items: end; column-gap: 64px; }
  }
/* The destinations: an editorial numbered list */
.dest-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline-firm); }
.dest-list li { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
.dest-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) clamp(220px, 26vw, 320px); grid-template-areas: "meta img" "name img" "desc img"; grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr; column-gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px); align-items: start; padding: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 40px) 0; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
.dest-meta { grid-area: meta; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
.dest-num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--brass); }
.dest-kicker { font-family: var(--font-stamp); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ash); }
.dest-name { grid-area: name; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.8rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.01em; transition: transform var(--dur-2) var(--ease); }
.dest-img { grid-area: img; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; transition: filter var(--dur-2) var(--ease); }
.dest-desc { grid-area: desc; margin: 16px 0 0; max-width: 48ch; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ash); }
@media (hover: hover) { .dest-row:hover .dest-name { transform: translateX(10px); } .dest-row:hover .dest-img { filter: brightness(1.07); } }
.dest-row:focus-visible .dest-name { transform: translateX(10px); }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dest-name, .dest-img { transition: none; } }
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .dest-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-areas: "meta" "name" "img" "desc"; grid-template-rows: auto; padding: 28px 0; }
  .dest-name { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 12vw, 3.4rem); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .dest-meta { margin-bottom: 10px; }
}

/* Field notes */
#field-notes { padding-bottom: clamp(44px, 5vw, 64px); }
#collection { padding-top: clamp(44px, 5vw, 64px); }
.fn-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 32px; }
.fn-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
.fn-card img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; margin-bottom: 6px; transition: filter var(--dur-2) var(--ease); }
.fn-label { font-family: var(--font-stamp); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brass); }
.fn-card h3 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 2.8vw, 2.35rem); line-height: 1.02; }
.fn-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ash); }
@media (hover: hover) { .fn-card:hover img { filter: brightness(1.07); } .fn-card:hover h3 { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 5px; } }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .fn-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 44px; } .fn-card img { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; } }
</style>
